 ### `GET /health`
 
 Returns 200 with `{"status": "ok"}`.
+
+### `GET /receipts/<id>`
+
+Returns the receipt of the signed-in customer, or 404 with `{"error": "receipt not found"}`. A receipt of another customer is also a 404.
+
+### `GET /receipts/search?q=<text>`
+
+Returns `{"receipts": [...]}` with the signed-in customer's receipts whose memo contains the text. `q` can be at most 100 characters, otherwise the answer is 400 with `{"error": "q is too long"}`.
